      hu: ["Az Upper Fort Garry 1835-ben épült helyi mészkő felhasználásával.", "Louis Riel 1869-ben foglalta el az erődöt a Red River-i lázadás során.", "Az erőd több mint 40 éven át volt a nyugati prémkereskedelem központja.", "Az épületek többségét 1881 és 1884 között bontották le.", "A megmaradt északi kapu 1924 óta nemzeti történelmi emlékhely.", "A Hudson’s Bay Company innen irányította a hatalmas Rupert-földet."],
      ro: ["Upper Fort Garry a fost construit în 1835 folosind calcar local.", "Louis Riel a ocupat fortul în 1869 în timpul Rebeliunii de la Red River.", "Fortul a fost centrul comerțului cu blănuri din vest timp de peste 40 de ani.", "Majoritatea clădirilor au fost demolate între 1881 și 1884.", "Poarta de nord rămasă este Sit Istoric Național din anul 1924.", "Compania Hudson’s Bay a utilizat fortul ca sediu pentru Rupert's Land."],
      en: ["Upper Fort Garry was constructed in 1835 using local limestone.", "Louis Riel seized the fort in 1869 during the Red River Resistance.", "The fort was the center of the western fur trade for over 40 years.", "Most of the fort's structures were demolished between 1881 and 1884.", "The remaining North Gate was designated a National Historic Site in 1924.", "The Hudson’s Bay Company used the fort as its headquarters for Rupert's Land."],
